{
  "name": "nolanguage",
  "version": "0.7.23",
  "private": true,
  "type": "module",
  "description": "Unified multi-language dev & execution platform — stages 1–6: minimal kernel (three buses + performance & log spines), live dev panel (WebSocket + UI), a Python + LSP closed loop (RPC instrumentation + LSP log collection), an interactive multi-language workspace (write, run, check, complete), Go support (toolchain discovery + GoRunner + gopls), and a baseline system (git commit 打点 + SQLite warm tier + long-term metric baselines).",
